<title>UK: Volkswagen unit sets 20 bln yen three-year samurai.</title>
<headline>Volkswagen unit sets 20 bln yen three-year samurai.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Kokusai.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VOLKSWAGEN FINANCIAL SERVICES NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  VOLKSWAGEN FINANCIAL SERVICES AG</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON    *5.15 PCT  MATURITY    27.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  150 BP    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*REDEMPTION IN U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 500</p>
</text>
